          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display not attempted"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_NOT_ATTEMPTED",
          "id": "1774380638692",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774380638693_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use the following Array of Json objects to generate a single multiRecordWidget : {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_NOT_ATTEMPTED_RESULTS_LIST.$output.result}} \n\nThe columns for the multiRecordWidget should be \"Batch\",\"Primary Product\",\"Batch Quantity\",\"Start Date\"\n\n1) Extract `Batch`, `PrimaryProduct`,`BatchQuantity` , `BatchUomCode`,`StartDate`  from each item in the array to populate each row in multiRecordWidget \nAlso extract `WorkOrderId`(this will NOT be visible but will be used)\n\n* #ACTION For each row, generate an actionable insight using the following options:\ntitle:\"RunCheck\"\nfollowUpCommand: ora.Invoke(refreshAgent,{\"command\": \"RunCheck\",\"WorkOrderId\":<WorkOrderId>,\"Batch\":<Batch>})   where <WorkOrderId> and <Batch> are the values you extracted from the array\nactionText: \"Run Check\"\nshortDescription: \"Executes the conformance check for the specificed batch\"\n\n**IMPORTANT\n-For the \"Batch quantity\" column display both the BatchQuantity and BatchUomCode\n-The title should be: \"Conformance Check not attempted\"\n-Generate a brief summary explaining what Not attempted status means(that the conformance check logic has not been executed for the batch)\nFor the `Start Date` column, use the extracted `StartDate` value and compare it against:\n\n{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}\n\nApply the rules below exactly as written.\n\nImportant rules:\n\n-If the JSON array does not have data for you to generate the widget, do not generate it, instead, display this user-facing message:\n\nThere are currently no batches with not attempted conformance check status in the specified time frame.\n\nRules for empty data message:\n- Use this exact meaning in the response\n- Keep the message user-friendly and concise\n- Do not mention internal implementation details such as JSON, payload, dataset, or response structure\n- Do not say \"there is no data in the JSON\"\n- If the data is empty, show only the empty-state message\n\n- `StartDate` is in `YYYY-MM-DD` format\n- Compare dates only at the calendar-day level\n- Ignore all time components\n- Determine the difference in whole days between `StartDate` and `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}`\n\nOutput rules for the `Start Date` column:\n\n1. If `StartDate` is the same calendar date as `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}`:\n   - Display text: `Due today`\n\n2. If `StartDate` is exactly 1 day after `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}`:\n   - Display text: `Due tomorrow`\n\n3. If `StartDate` is before `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}`:\n   - Display text: `<N> days past due`\n   - Replace `<N>` with the absolute number of days between the two dates\n\n4. If `StartDate` is more than 1 day after `{{$context.$system.$currentDate}}`:\n   - Display the `StartDate` formatted as `MM/DD/YYYY`\n\nDo not use any other wording.\nDo not include time values.\nDo not infer hours or partial days.\nUse only one of the four outputs above."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Is command recommendation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1778530719454",
            "false": "1774471033165"
          },
          "code": "IS_COMMAND_RECOMMENDATION",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1778530471099",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778530471101_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.CHECK_COMMANDS_HAS_RECOMMENDATION.$output.result}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract substitute payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let formContent = $context.$nodes.DETERMINE_IF_IS_ORA_FORM_SUBMISSION.$output.result.Json;\nlet items = $context.$nodes.GET_MATERIALS_FOR_SUBSTITUTION.$output.items;\n\nlet itemsToSubstituteArr = [];\nitems.forEach(item =>{\n    itemsToSubstituteArr.push(item.ItemNumber);\n}); \n\nif (typeof formContent === \"string\") {\n    let jsonObj = JSON.parse(formContent);\n    let newObj = {\n        itemsToSubstitute: \"\",\n        requiredQty: \"\",\n        itemsSubstitutes: \"\",\n        itemsSubstitutesQuantities: \"\"\n    };\n    const sortedKeys = Object.keys(jsonObj).sort((a, b) => Number(a) - Number(b));\n\n    let isIngredientPopulated = false;\n\n    let auxIndex = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < sortedKeys.length; i = i + 2) {\n        const key = sortedKeys[i];\n        const substituteValue = jsonObj[key].value;\n        const ingredientLabel = jsonObj[key].label;\n        let ingredientToSubstitute = itemsToSubstituteArr[auxIndex];\n        auxIndex++;\n\n        let quantityIndex = i + 1;\n        const quantityKey = sortedKeys[quantityIndex];\n\n        let itemSubstituteValue = substituteValue;\n\n        let quantitySubstituteValue = jsonObj[quantityKey].value;\n        let itemSubstitutePopulated = false;\n        let quantitySubstitutePopulated = false;\n\n        if (ingredientToSubstitute != null) {\n\n            if(ingredientToSubstitute.toString().trim() !== \"\"){\n                \n                if (itemSubstituteValue != null) { //If item substitute is populated\n                \n                    if(itemSubstituteValue.toString().trim() !== \"\"){\n                        itemSubstitutePopulated = true;\n                    }\n                        \n                }\n\n                if (quantitySubstituteValue != null) { //If quantity substitute is populated\n                    if(quantitySubstituteValue.toString().trim() != \"\"){\n                        quantitySubstitutePopulated = true;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (itemSubstitutePopulated || quantitySubstitutePopulated) {\n                    newObj.itemsToSubstitute += (newObj.itemsToSubstitute ? \"<CONFRM_CHECK>\" : \"\") + ingredientToSubstitute;\n\n                    if (itemSubstitutePopulated) {\n                        newObj.itemsSubstitutes += (newObj.itemsSubstitutes ? \"<CONFRM_CHECK>\" : \"\") + itemSubstituteValue;\n                    } else {\n                        newObj.itemsSubstitutes += (newObj.itemsSubstitutes ? \"<CONFRM_CHECK>\" : \"\") + \"[NOT_SET]\";\n                    }\n\n                    if (quantitySubstitutePopulated) {\n                        newObj.itemsSubstitutesQuantities += (newObj.itemsSubstitutesQuantities ? \"<CONFRM_CHECK>\" : \"\") + quantitySubstituteValue;\n                    } else {\n                        newObj.itemsSubstitutesQuantities += (newObj.itemsSubstitutesQuantities ? \"<CONFRM_CHECK>\" : \"\") + \"[NOT_SET]\";\n                    }\n\n                }\n\n            }\n\n        }\n\n\n\n    }\n\n    return newObj;\n}"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775595013525"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_SUBSTITUTE_PAYLOAD",
          "id": "1775585049125",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract quantity simulation payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let formContent = $context.$nodes.DETERMINE_IF_IS_ORA_FORM_SUBMISSION.$output.result.Json;\nlet items = $context.$nodes.GET_INGREDIENTS_FOR_QUANTITY_SIMULATION.$output.items;\n\nlet itemsToSubstituteArr = [];\nitems.forEach(item =>{\n    itemsToSubstituteArr.push(item.ItemNumber);\n}); \n\nif (typeof formContent === \"string\") {\n    let jsonObj = JSON.parse(formContent);\n    let newObj = {\n        itemsToSubstitute: \"\",\n        requiredQty: \"\",\n        itemsSubstitutesQuantities: \"\"\n    };\n    const sortedKeys = Object.keys(jsonObj).sort((a, b) => Number(a) - Number(b));\n\n    let isIngredientPopulated = false;\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < sortedKeys.length; i++) {\n        const key = sortedKeys[i];\n        let quantitySubstituteValue = jsonObj[key].value;\n        let ingredientToSubstitute = itemsToSubstituteArr[i];\n\n        let quantitySubstitutePopulated = false;\n\n        if (ingredientToSubstitute != null) {\n\n            if(ingredientToSubstitute.toString().trim() !== \"\"){\n                \n                if (quantitySubstituteValue != null) { //If quantity substitute is populated\n                    \n                    if(quantitySubstituteValue.toString().trim() != \"\"){\n                        quantitySubstitutePopulated = true;\n                    }\n                \n                }\n\n                if (quantitySubstitutePopulated) {\n                    \n                    newObj.itemsToSubstitute += (newObj.itemsToSubstitute ? \"<CONFRM_CHECK>\" : \"\") + ingredientToSubstitute;\n\n                    if (quantitySubstitutePopulated) {\n                        newObj.itemsSubstitutesQuantities += (newObj.itemsSubstitutesQuantities ? \"<CONFRM_CHECK>\" : \"\") + quantitySubstituteValue;\n                    } else {\n                        newObj.itemsSubstitutesQuantities += (newObj.itemsSubstitutesQuantities ? \"<CONFRM_CHECK>\" : \"\") + \"[NOT_SET]\";\n                    }\n\n                }\n\n            }\n\n        }\n\n\n\n    }\n\n    return newObj;\n}"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775607969322"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_QUANTITY_SIMULATION_PAYLOAD",
          "id": "1775607482842",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
