        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_SCM_MANUFACTUR_CONFORMANCECHECKRECOMMENDATIONEXECUTION",
            "functionName": "executeRecommendation",
            "name": "Execute recommendation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1778531187648"
          },
          "code": "EXECUTE_RECOMMENDATION",
          "id": "1778531032736",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778531032736_WorkOrderId",
              "name": "WorkOrderId",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_VIEW_RECOMMENDATION_PAYLOAD.$output.result.WorkOrderId}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_CARD"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display recommendation details"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DISPLAY_RECOMMENDATION_DETAILS",
          "id": "1778695432778",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778695432784_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use the following JSON object to generate a brief recommendation explanation and one or two `cardWidget` components:\n\n{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_RECOMMENDATION_DETAILS_PAYLOAD.$output.result}}\n\n-----------------------------------\nDATA EXTRACTION RULES\n-----------------------------------\n\nExtract the following attributes from the JSON object:\n\n- `Ingredient`\n- `Lot`\n- `ConformanceParameter`\n- `OriginalActualValue`\n- `OriginalQuantity`\n- `OriginalUOM`\n- `SubstituteIngredient`\n- `AlternateLot`\n- `RecommendationActualValue`\n- `RecommendationQuantity`\n- `RecommendationUOM`\n\nUse only values extracted from the provided JSON object.\n\n-----------------------------------\nSUBSTITUTE AVAILABILITY RULES\n-----------------------------------\n\nA substitute recommendation is considered available only if at least one of the following values is present and not null:\n\n- `SubstituteIngredient`\n- `AlternateLot`\n- `RecommendationActualValue`\n- `RecommendationQuantity`\n- `RecommendationUOM`\n\nIf substitute recommendation values are available:\n- Generate two `cardWidget` components:\n  1. Original ingredient card\n  2. Recommended ingredient card\n\nIf substitute recommendation values are not available:\n- Generate only one `cardWidget` component:\n  1. Original ingredient card\n- Do not generate the recommended ingredient card.\n- The summary must clearly state that no substitute was identified for the high contribution ingredient.\n\n-----------------------------------\nOUTPUT STRUCTURE\n-----------------------------------\n\nGenerate the output in this order:\n\n1. A brief, user-friendly summary\n2. The original ingredient `cardWidget`\n3. The recommended ingredient `cardWidget`, only if substitute recommendation values are available\n\n-----------------------------------\nSUMMARY REQUIREMENTS\n-----------------------------------\n\nIf substitute recommendation values are available, write a concise summary explaining why the substitute ingredient and alternate lot are recommended.\n\nThe summary must:\n\n- Mention the original ingredient and lot\n- Mention the substitute ingredient and alternate lot\n- Compare the original actual value against the recommendation actual value\n- Reference the `ConformanceParameter`\n- Reference the original quantity and recommended quantity\n- Explain why the substitute ingredient or alternate lot is a better choice based on the conformance parameter and quantity\n- Keep the explanation concise and user-friendly\n\nIf substitute recommendation values are not available, write a concise summary that:\n\n- Mentions the original ingredient and lot\n- References the `ConformanceParameter`\n- Mentions the original actual value and original quantity\n- Clearly states that no substitute was identified for the high contribution ingredient\n- Avoids mentioning substitute ingredient, alternate lot, recommendation actual value, or recommendation quantity\n\nDo not invent reasons, values, or recommendations that are not supported by the provided JSON object.\n\n-----------------------------------\nORIGINAL INGREDIENT CARD\n-----------------------------------\n\nAlways create one `cardWidget` for the original ingredient using these exact properties:\n\n- `Subject`: `<Ingredient> - <Lot>`\n- `Subtitle`: `<ConformanceParameter> : <OriginalActualValue>`\n- `Summary`: `Required: <OriginalQuantity> <OriginalUOM>`\n- `Variant`: `error`\n\nDisplay a badge at the bottom of the card with:\n\n- `priority`: `alert`\n- `text`: `High contribution ingredient`\n\n-----------------------------------\nRECOMMENDED INGREDIENT CARD\n-----------------------------------\n\nCreate this card only if substitute recommendation values are available.\n\nCreate one `cardWidget` for the recommended ingredient using these exact properties:\n\n- `Subject`: `<SubstituteIngredient> - <AlternateLot>`\n- `Subtitle`: `<ConformanceParameter> : <RecommendationActualValue>`\n- `Summary`: `Available: <RecommendationQuantity> <RecommendationUOM>`\n- `Variant`: `Info`\n\nDisplay a badge at the bottom of the card with:\n\n- `priority`: `success`\n- `text`: `Recommended Substitute with optimal reach`\n\n-----------------------------------\nIMPORTANT OUTPUT RULES\n-----------------------------------\n\n- Generate exactly two `cardWidget` components only when substitute recommendation values are available.\n- Generate exactly one `cardWidget` component when substitute recommendation values are not available.\n- Always generate the original ingredient card first.\n- Generate the recommended ingredient card second only when applicable.\n- Do not add extra card fields beyond the specified properties.\n- If a value is missing or null, leave that value blank.\n- Keep all wording concise, clear, and user-friendly.\n- Use only values from the provided JSON object.\n- Do not invent substitute values.\n- Do not imply that a substitute exists when substitute recommendation values are missing or null."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract basic simulation results",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "let data = $context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_BASIC_SIMULATION_RESULTS.$output.items;\n\nlet jsonArr = [];\n\nfor (const detail of data) {\n   let newObj = {\n      \"ParameterCode\":detail.ParameterCode,\n      \"MinimumTargetValue\":detail.MinimumTargetValue,\n      \"MaximumTargetValue\":detail.MaximumTargetValue,\n      \"TargetValue\":detail.TargetValue,\n      \"CalculatedValue\":detail.CalculatedValue,\n      \"ConformanceCheckResultStatus\":detail.ConformanceCheckResultStatus,\n      \"WorkOrderNumber\":detail.WorkOrderNumber,\n      \"ConformanceCheckResultDate\":detail.ConformanceCheckResultDate\n   };\n\n  jsonArr.push(newObj);\n}\n\nreturn jsonArr;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775583638585"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_BASIC_SIMULATION_RESULTS",
          "id": "1777311444090",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract quantity simulation results",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "let data = $context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_QUANTITY_SIMULATION_RESULTS.$output.items;\n\nlet jsonArr = [];\n\nfor (const detail of data) {\n   let newObj = {\n      \"ParameterCode\":detail.ParameterCode,\n      \"MinimumTargetValue\":detail.MinimumTargetValue,\n      \"MaximumTargetValue\":detail.MaximumTargetValue,\n      \"TargetValue\":detail.TargetValue,\n      \"CalculatedValue\":detail.CalculatedValue,\n      \"ConformanceCheckResultStatus\":detail.ConformanceCheckResultStatus,\n      \"WorkOrderNumber\":detail.WorkOrderNumber,\n      \"ConformanceCheckResultDate\":detail.ConformanceCheckResultDate\n   };\n\n  jsonArr.push(newObj);\n}\n\nreturn jsonArr;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775608160546"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_QUANTITY_SIMULATION_RESULTS",
          "id": "1777310579101",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
